    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a multiplayer game developed by Unity. There are two types of gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's plot tells the story of an organization called the Asylum in 2030, which caused a large number of projects to break out of containment in a level 5 containment accident. You will play the role of a member of the re-containment team and work hard to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real-time multiplayer mode is a real-time duel based on the network protocol. The game has a built-in server list. Server owners can add lists through the &quot;Add List&quot; function in the game. We are equipped with a server audit team that will regularly review each list server to ensure its legality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in the early stages of development, and the online story mode will be given priority for completion.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a multiplayer game developed by Unity. There are two types of gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's plot tells the story of an organization called the Asylum in 2030, which caused a large number of projects to break out of containment in a level 5 containment accident. You will play the role of a member of the re-containment team and work hard to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real-time multiplayer mode is a real-time duel based on the network protocol. The game has a built-in server list. Server owners can add lists through the &quot;Add List&quot; function in the game. We are equipped with a server audit team that will regularly review each list server to ensure its legality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in the early stages of development, and the online story mode will be given priority for completion.</p>",
